{"seq":3,"slug":"ideas-and-methods","title":"苏格拉底·ideas-and-methods","stage":"DONE","category":"socrates","categoryLabel":"苏格拉底","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/20_socrates/3_ideas-and-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"苏格拉底-思想与方法\">苏格拉底·思想与方法</h1><p>本 hub 系统呈现苏格拉底<strong>思想的实质内容与求知的方法</strong>——他的认识论起点（自知无知）、伦理学基石（美德即知识）、独创的对话方法（诘问法、反讽与助产），以及关于如何生活的根本教诲（未经省察的人生不值得过、照料灵魂）。这五大主题彼此咬合：承认无知 → 用诘问与助产求关于善的真知 → 因善可知而德性可求 → 故应省察人生、照料灵魂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>苏格拉底未留任何著作，其思想全凭柏拉图、色诺芬等人转述，故各兄弟 hub 视角不同、互不重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>雅典背景、街头哲人、审判与死亡（前 399 年）</td>\n<td>提供本 hub 思想产生与践行的历史现场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他在哲学史上的定位：转向人事、奠定方法</td>\n<td>宏观贡献评价；本 hub 深入方法的<strong>内部机制</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>3 思想与方法（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>观念内容 + 求知方法本身</strong></td>\n<td>不复述生平，不做史学考据，专注&quot;他想什么、怎么想&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 主要著作</a></td>\n<td>思想的<strong>文本载体</strong>：柏拉图对话、色诺芬记述</td>\n<td>本 hub 用这些文本为据，但聚焦观念非文献学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>思想如何被柏拉图、亚里士多德、斯多葛派继承</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲思想本身，5 讲其下游传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>&quot;苏格拉底问题&quot;：哪些思想真属历史苏格拉底</td>\n<td>本 hub 取主流柏拉图早期对话之说，史料真伪争议归 6</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条贯穿原则：<strong>同一事实只在主篇展开</strong>。例如审判语境在 <a href=\"../life-and-times/trial-and-death/the-trial\">生平·审判</a> 主讲，本 hub 各篇仅在必要处链接；&quot;苏格拉底问题&quot;的文本真伪在 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/the-socratic-problem/\">6 争议</a> 主讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;① 自知无知&lt;br/&gt;认识论起点&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;② 美德即知识&lt;br/&gt;伦理学基石&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;③ 诘问法&lt;br/&gt;方法的逻辑&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;④ 反讽与助产&lt;br/&gt;方法的姿态与目的&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;⑤ 未经省察的人生&lt;br/&gt;人生纲领·破&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;⑥ 照料灵魂&lt;br/&gt;人生纲领·立&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"① 自知无知&lt;br/&gt;认识论起点\"] --&gt; B[\"② 美德即知识&lt;br/&gt;伦理学基石\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"③ 诘问法&lt;br/&gt;方法的逻辑\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"④ 反讽与助产&lt;br/&gt;方法的姿态与目的\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"⑤ 未经省察的人生&lt;br/&gt;人生纲领·破\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"⑥ 照料灵魂&lt;br/&gt;人生纲领·立\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置知识</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 了解雅典民主、智者派与审判背景，再入本 hub。</li>\n<li><strong>建议顺序</strong>：1.1 自知无知 → 1.2 美德即知识 → 2.1 诘问法 → 2.2 反讽与助产 → 3.1 未经省察的人生 → 3.2 照料灵魂。前两章是&quot;想什么+怎么想&quot;，第三章是&quot;该怎么活&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"各章导览\">各章导览</h2><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"knowing-and-ignorance/\">1 知与无知</a></strong>：<a href=\"knowing-and-ignorance/i-know-that-i-know-nothing\">自知无知</a>（求知的起点，文本辨正）｜<a href=\"knowing-and-ignorance/knowledge-is-virtue\">美德即知识</a>（道德理智主义与亚里士多德的反驳）。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"the-midwifery/\">2 助产术</a></strong>：<a href=\"the-midwifery/the-elenchus\">诘问法</a>（弗拉斯托斯式标准形式与&quot;诘问法的难题&quot;）｜<a href=\"the-midwifery/irony-and-maieutics\">反讽与助产</a>（eironeia 与 maieutics 的张力）。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"the-examined-life/\">3 省察的人生</a></strong>：<a href=\"the-examined-life/the-unexamined-life\">未经省察的人生不值得过</a>（申辩篇 38a 的语境与现代回响）｜<a href=\"the-examined-life/care-for-the-soul\">照料灵魂</a>（灵魂中心的价值次序）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"跨人物链接\">跨人物链接</h2><p>苏格拉底的思想经两位弟子分流：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>柏拉图</strong>把诘问发展为辩证法、把&quot;美德即知识&quot;嵌入理型论与回忆说——见 <a href=\"../../plato/ideas-and-methods/\">柏拉图·思想与方法</a>（<a href=\"../../plato/ideas-and-methods/epistemology/\">认识论</a>、<a href=\"../../plato/ideas-and-methods/the-soul/\">论灵魂</a>、<a href=\"../../plato/ideas-and-methods/dialectic/\">辩证法</a>）与 <a href=\"../../plato/core-contributions/the-theory-of-forms/\">理型论</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>亚里士多德</strong>以 akrasia 与实践智慧修正道德理智主义——见 <a href=\"../../aristotle/ideas-and-methods/ethics-of-virtue/\">亚里士多德·德性伦理</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"knowing-and-ignorance","title":"Knowing And Ignorance","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/knowing-and-ignorance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"i-know-that-i-know-nothing","title":"自知无知","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/knowing-and-ignorance/i-know-that-i-know-nothing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"knowledge-is-virtue","title":"美德即知识","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/knowing-and-ignorance/knowledge-is-virtue"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-midwifery","title":"The Midwifery","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-midwifery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-elenchus","title":"诘问法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-midwifery/the-elenchus"},{"seq":2,"slug":"irony-and-maieutics","title":"反讽与助产","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-midwifery/irony-and-maieutics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"the-examined-life","title":"The Examined Life","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-examined-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-unexamined-life","title":"未经省察的人生不值得过","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-examined-life/the-unexamined-life"},{"seq":2,"slug":"care-for-the-soul","title":"照料灵魂","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-examined-life/care-for-the-soul"}]}]}